{
	"Name": "ScheduledSearch - Okta - User - MFA - Okta Security Question Factor Reset",
	"Description": "A security question factor was reset. Security questions are the weakest factor Okta offers, and resetting one is a common step in a self-service recovery takeover because the answers are usually guessable or already breached.\n\nEvent types: user.mfa.factor.deactivate, user.mfa.factor.reset_all with an outcome reason naming the SECURITY_QUESTION factor\n\nReference(s):\n- https://developer.okta.com/docs/reference/api/event-types/\n- https://developer.okta.com/docs/api/openapi/okta-management/management/tag/SystemLog/\n\nThis scheduled search is a dispatcher on \"Alert - Okta - Alert Router\". Its name is what appears as the alert name, so rename it here if you want the alerts named differently.\n\nIt ships disabled; enable it once you have reviewed the query and are happy with the volume it produces.",
	"Labels": [
		"okta"
	],
	"Schedule": "*/15 * * * *",
	"Duration": -900,
	"DefaultDeploymentRules": {
		"Disabled": true,
		"RunImmediately": false
	},
